	(text "DESAT > 10.3-10.9 V (above the 10.0 V maximum trip of the -Q1 grade) -> MMBT3904 -> MMBT3906 charges BG to VEE + 10 V;\nper device AO3400A + 22R pull the gate to VEE; BG holds ~3 us (1k + FET gates)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.222 269.348 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "02e16176-6d49-5d3c-b19a-759d34c79527")
	)
	(text "AH: MILLER CLAMP CONTROL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 193.424 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "192986de-ff3b-5469-831b-1cefa100cd9d")
	)
	(text "IN+ = own PWM; IN- = complementary switch, falling edge stretched 3.65k/100p\n(interlock + min dead time = max(firmware, hardware)). Bias PG (active low) pulls RDY low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 90.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3cdffe32-fea5-545a-94d7-cbf88f29a884")
	)
	(text "AH: SHORT-CIRCUIT BOOSTER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.222 193.424 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8207605b-908d-567c-8f75-b15db0ede4a3")
	)
	(text "2 x ZXTP25040DFH emitter followers on OUTL (B-E 1k, C to VEE): each sinks the Roff current of 3 gates;\nthe NSI6651 supplies base current only. Turn-on stays on OUTH."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 467.503 73.152 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "88488c82-1c86-55d9-bd8d-c13acdb901df")
	)
	(text "MMBT3906 inverter (E COM, base BAT54+2.2k on CLAMP) drives CG to COM once the lowest gate is below ~-1.2 V;\nMMBT3904 release (from OUTH via 5.6 V Zener) holds CG at VEE while OUTH drives."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 283.712 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "89e5cd89-e944-5e09-9a9d-801e34c9542d")
	)
	(text "Per device: Ron/Roff, 0.5R Kelvin R to the COM star, 10k and Zeners (about +21 V / -5.7 V) on its own Kelvin net.\nMiller hold: N-MOSFET clamp (PMV30ENEA) gate-pin to a local VEE (1u on the Kelvin pin). LAYOUT: FET + 1u at the device, loop <= 1 nH."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 157.516 180.924 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "91144be1-349b-5ea2-99ff-9e8050fbb12d")
	)
